      "number": 13,
      "title": "Formula Cheat Sheet",
      "text": [
        "Interest",
        "A = P(1+r/n)^(nt) | A = Pe^(rt)",
        "Log ↔ Exp",
        "b^y = x ⟺ log_b(x) = y | ln(aⁿ) = n·ln(a)",
        "DMS",
        "D + M/60 + S/3600 | Deg→Rad: ×π/180 | Rad→Deg: ×180/π",
        "Arc/Sector",
        "s = rθ (rad) | A = ½r²θ (rad) | Always convert θ to radians first!",
        "Triangle",
        "A = ½bh | Heron's: s=(a+b+c)/2, A=√[s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)]",
        "Trapezoid",
        "A = ½(b₁+b₂)h | May need: h²+d²=slant², d=b₂−b₁",
        "Parallel Lines",
        "Proportional segments: AB/BD = AC/CE",
        "Circles",
        "Central ∠ = arc | Inscribed ∠ = ½(arc) | Chords: ∠ = ½(arc₁+arc₂)",
        "Speed",
        "ω = θ/t | v = rω | 1 rev = 2π rad | ft/min → mph: ×60÷5280",
        "Good luck on Test 2! Remember: show all work for full credit."
      ],
